# Talk media lives on disk but not in git: originals, videos, Blender scenes,
# PowerPoint decks and the multi-megabyte Inkscape figures. Together they are
# ~1.6 GB, which is more than a repo should carry. Anything at or above 1 MB,
# plus the always-binary formats, sits under a talk's media/ directory. The
# per-talk GitHub repos listed in each README still hold these files, so a
# fresh clone of this repo can recover them.
media/
